<title>NEW ZEALAND: Adrian Ho has 5.39 pct of CDL Investments.</title>
<headline>Adrian Ho has 5.39 pct of CDL Investments.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singaporean Adrian Ho has become a substantial security holder in property developer CDL Investments NZ Ltd on April 3, taking an interest in 5.39 percent of its voting stock, the company said in a release through the New Zealand Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
